end="51.672">还</span><span begin="51.672" end="52.560">笑</span><span begin="52.831" end="53.468">着</span><span begin="53.468" end="54.010">跟</span><span begin="54.010" end="54.689">友人</span><span begin="54.689" end="55.200">道</span><span begin="55.200" end="56.132">别</span></p><p begin="56.961" end="1:00.889" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.961" end="57.988">穿人字</span><span begin="57.988" end="58.291">的</span><span begin="58.291" end="58.816">拖</span><span begin="58.816" end="1:00.889">鞋</span></p></div><div begin="1:04.181" end="1:34.482" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:04.181" end="1:08.706" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.181" end="1:05.850">我</span><span begin="1:05.850" end="1:06.270">还</span><span begin="1:06.270" end="1:07.077">记</span><span begin="1:07.077" end="1:08.706">得</span></p><p begin="1:10.291" end="1:16.396" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.291" end="1:11.442">你离开的</span><span begin="1:11.442" end="1:12.375">夜班</span><span begin="1:12.375" end="1:13.013">车</span> <span begin="1:13.145" end="1:13.815">是蓝</span><span begin="1:13.815" end="1:14.491">色</span><span begin="1:14.491" end="1:16.396">的</span></p><p begin="1:17.527" end="1:22.883" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.527" end="1:18.653">造梦的人</span><span begin="1:18.653" end="1:19.962">逃离</span><span begin="1:19.962" end="1:20.850">拥挤的</span><span begin="1:20.850" end="1:21.676">巷</span><span begin="1:21.676" end="1:22.883">弄</span></p><p begin="1:23.430" end="1:34.482" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.430" end="1:25.342">我像路人</span><span begin="1:25.342" end="1:26.678">普</span><span begin="1:26.678" end="1:27.879">通</span> <span begin="1:28.688" end="1:30.699">灯牌的背后</span><span begin="1:30.699" end="1:31.226">都</span><span begin="1:31.226" end="1:32.302">是</span><span begin="1:32.302" end="1:32.744">苦</span><span begin="1:32.744" end="1:34.482">涩</span></p></div><div begin="1:34.827" end="2:04.526" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:34.827" end="1:38.766" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.827" end="1:35.315">我</span><span begin="1:35.315" end="1:35.648">还</span><span begin="1:35.648" end="1:36.296">记</span><span begin="1:36.296" end="1:38.766">得</span></p><p begin="1:39.339" end="1:46.379" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.339" end="1:40.611">呼吸传来</span><span begin="1:40.611" end="1:41.507">的阵</span><span begin="1:41.507" end="1:42.191">痛</span> <span begin="1:42.357" end="1:42.562">是</span><span begin="1:42.562" end="1:43.037">刺</span><span begin="1:43.037" end="1:43.565">耳</span><span begin="1:43.565" end="1:46.379">的</span></p><p begin="1:46.627" end="1:52.158" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.627" end="1:47.107">快乐</span><span begin="1:47.107" end="1:47.580">被</span><span begin="1:47.580" end="1:47.866">遗</span><span begin="1:47.866" end="1:48.208">忘</span><span begin="1:48.208" end="1:48.900">在</span><span begin="1:48.900" end="1:50.007">花店的</span><span begin="1:50.007" end="1:50.579">角</span><span begin="1:50.579" end="1:52.158">落</span></p><p begin="1:52.399" end="2:04.526" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.399" end="1:54.332">你闭眼我就</span><span begin="1:54.332" end="1:55.771">路</span><span begin="1:55.771" end="1:57.744">过</span> <span begin="1:58.594" end="1:59.629">真实的</span><span begin="1:59.629" end="2:00.721">存在</span><span begin="2:00.721" end="2:01.318">又禁</span><span begin="2:01.318" end="2:02.128">止</span><span begin="2:02.128" end="2:02.578">触</span><span begin="2:02.578" end="2:04.526">摸</span></p></div><div begin="2:17.862" end="2:43.691" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:17.862" end="2:23.572" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:17.862" end="2:18.248">我还</span><span begin="2:18.248" end="2:18.791">在</span><span begin="2:18.791" end="2:20.462">深秋以后</span><span begin="2:20.462" end="2:22.445">会冒热气的</span><span begin="2:22.445" end="2:22.861">小</span><span begin="2:22.861" en